🔹 1. Zapier – AI Content Generator API (Google Gemini)

What it does:
	•	User submits a topic via Google Form
	•	Zapier routes it → Google Gemini AI generates title, outline, and full article
	•	Output sent to client email
	•	Data logged into company Google Sheets

Skills demonstrated:
	•	Zapier routing & Paths
	•	Google Gemini AI integration
	•	Email automation
	•	Google Sheets logging
	•	Micro-API workflow design

