🔹 2. Make ↔ Zapier – Dual Automation Sync

What it does:
	•	Un-enriched data stored in Google sheets in Make
	•	Data sent to Zapier via webhook from Make
	•	Zapier AI enriches the data → passes through formatter
	•	Data returned to Make → stored in Google Sheets

Skills demonstrated:
	•	Multi-platform workflow orchestration
	•	Webhooks & POST/response handling
	•	Zapier AI enrichment & data formatting
	•	Make routing & JSON handling
	•	Data logging & validation

